# Project-local harness (Claude Code, remember)
# .claude/ tracks settings.json + hooks/ (replan-on-ship infra), but
# ignores per-clone state (last-shipped-tag marker, local settings).
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
.claude/.last-shipped-tag
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude-cache/
.claude-plans/
.remember/
.task/
LESSONS.md
CLAUDE.md

